<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('./layouts/head'); -%>
  <style>
    .content.has-text-left {
      text-align: left;
    }
    .content p {
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
    <% if (isAuthenticated && userRole==='admin') { %>
        <header id="header">
          <%- include('./layouts/header'); -%>
        </header>
    <% } %>

  <section class="section" style="padding: 30px;margin: 30px;">
      <div class="container">
          <div class="content has-text-left">
              <h2 class="title is-3">About MundoGIS</h2>
              <p>We specialize in delivering high-quality training, workshops, and consulting services with a strong focus on open-source GIS solutions. We also develop advanced software tools that improve workflows across 2D and 3D GIS environments.</p>
              <p>Whether you need support with geospatial data management, GIS analysis, 3D visualization, or custom GIS development, MundoGIS provides tailored solutions designed to meet your specific needs.</p>

              <div class="box">
                  <h3 class="title is-5"><a href="https://github.com/MundoGIS/Qtiler" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Qtiler</a></h3>
                  <p>Qtiler is a tile cache and OGC service platform for publishing geospatial data from QGIS projects. It generates WMTS, WMS, WFS, and vector tile services, making it easier to share and serve maps in production environments.</p>
                  <p>For this application, terrain data can be obtained from Qtiler when using a QGIS project that contains DTM terrain layers. This is the recommended approach when a reliable terrain source is needed for 3D visualization.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="box">
                  <h3 class="title is-5"><a href="https://github.com/MundoGIS/OpenFME-Scheduler" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenFME-Scheduler</a></h3>
                  <p>OpenFME-Scheduler is a browser-based platform for managing and automating FME workflows. It allows users to upload scripts, schedule jobs, run processes on demand, and monitor execution logs from a single interface.</p>
                  <p>It helps streamline operational GIS automation and supports repeatable processing tasks for organizations relying on FME-based pipelines.</p>
              </div>

              <p>If you have any questions or would like more information, feel free to get in touch:</p>
              <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@mundogis.se">support@mundogis.se</a></p>
              <p>
                  <a href="https://mundogis.se/kontakt/" target="_blank" class="button is-primary is-medium">Contact us</a>
              </p>
          </div>
      </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
      <div class="content has-text-centered">
          <p>MundoGIS &copy; 2024</p>
      </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
